ink": null, "locked": false, "text": "The program fills the frozen template word for word; only the greeting and the org's short name\nchange. Zapier creates the Gmail draft with the PDF attached. A final check reads the raw draft back\n(attachment, links, Bcc, recipients, subject) before it counts. Never sent by a machine.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The program fills the frozen template word for word; only the greeting and the org's short name\nchange. Zapier creates the Gmail draft with the PDF attached. A final check reads the raw draft back\n(attachment, links, Bcc, recipients, subject) before it counts. Never sent by a machine.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r187", "type": "rectangle", "x": 576.0, "y": 3365, "width": 948, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#A21CAF", "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 85, "groupIds": ["PHASE 5  -  DRAFT EMAIL 1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1582123416, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1050709854, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t188", "type": "text", "x": 590.0, "y": 3372, "width": 885, "height": 39, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6B6B6B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["PHASE 5  -  DRAFT EMAIL 1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 859077492, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146922802, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "reads: orgs with a ready recipient set, Gmail checked first (one thread per org), the template + PDF ->\nwrites: Email 1 DRAFTS in Gmail, the drafts ledger", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null